[?2004l[?2004h> +The corrected implementation performs a ``merge_asof`` on ``snapshot_date`` after converting the
[?2004l[?2004h> +prediction timestamp to a date (floored to UTC midnight).  This guarantees that snapshots that are
[?2004l[?2004h> +recorded on the same day as the prediction are not visible to the model.
[?2004l[?2004h> +"""
[?2004l[?2004h> +
