[?2004l[?2004h> +with ``label_available_at < t`` are considered.  The original implementation ignored both ``as_of``
[?2004l[?2004h> +and ``label_available_at``, using *all* labels regardless of availability, which introduces leakage.
[?2004l[?2004h> +
